===Etymology===
From {{etyl|NL.|en}} {{m|la|zōophyton}}, from {{etyl|grc|en}} {{m|grc|ζωόφῠτον}}. Surface reading of {{confix|zoo|phyte|t1=animal|t2=plant|lang=en}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈzəʊəfaɪt/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|zoology}} Any of various [[invertebrate]] [[animals]] which resemble [[plants]], such as [[sponge]]s, [[coral]]s and [[sea anemone]]s.

